OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp during the evening, but tending
OL,7,Fto become drier and clearer during the
OL,8,Fearly hours. Staying mild, with the
OL,9,Fwarmth tempered a little by the brisk
OL,10,Fwind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FBrightest early on, as a
OL,13,Fweak band of mainly light rain edges
OL,14,Fsouthwards later, becoming slow-moving
OL,15,Fover the region. Warm, especially in
OL,16,Flimited bright or sunny intervals.
OL,17,FWinds gradually easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
